# EV Charging Station API - Complete Implementation with Self-Management & QR Codes

This document provides a comprehensive overview of the EV Charging Station API with all implemented features including EV owner self-management and QR code functionality.

## System Overview

The API provides a complete EV charging station management system with three types of users:
- **Backoffice Users**: System administrators with full access
- **Station Operators**: Can manage charging stations, approve bookings, and validate QR codes
- **EV Owners**: Can self-register, manage their accounts, make bookings, and access QR codes

## Core Features Implemented ✅

### A. User Management

#### 1. Web Application Users (Backoffice and Station Operator)
- **Endpoint**: `POST /api/auth/register` (Backoffice only can create users)
- **Endpoint**: `POST /api/auth/login`
- **Roles**: Backoffice, StationOperator
- **Authorization**: Role-based access control implemented

#### 2. EV Owner Self-Management ✅
- **Self-Registration**: `POST /api/evownerauth/register`
- **Profile Management**: `PUT /api/evownerauth/profile`
- **Self-Deactivation**: `POST /api/evownerauth/deactivate`
- **Reactivation**: `POST /api/evownerauth/reactivate/{nic}` (Backoffice only)
- **Primary Key**: NIC (National Identity Card)

### B. Reservation Management ✅

#### 1. Booking Creation with Summary
- **Summary**: `POST /api/bookings/summary` - Preview booking before confirmation
- **Create**: `POST /api/bookings` - Create booking (pending approval)
- **Modify**: `PUT /api/bookings/{id}` - Update pending bookings
- **Cancel**: `DELETE /api/bookings/{id}` - Cancel bookings

#### 2. Booking Approval Workflow ✅
- **Pending Bookings**: `GET /api/bookings/pending` (Station Operators & Backoffice)
- **Approve**: `POST /api/bookings/{id}/approve`
- **Reject**: `POST /api/bookings/{id}/reject`
- **QR Code Generation**: Automatic upon approval

#### 3. QR Code Integration ✅
- **Generate**: Automatic QR code creation when booking approved
- **Access**: `GET /api/bookings/{id}/qrcode` (EV Owner access to own QR codes)
- **Validate**: `POST /api/bookings/validate-qr` (Station Operator validation)

### C. View Bookings ✅

#### 1. EV Owner Booking Views
- **All Bookings**: `GET /api/bookings/my-bookings`
- **Upcoming**: `GET /api/bookings/my-bookings/upcoming`
- **History**: `GET /api/bookings/my-bookings/history`

#### 2. Administrative Views
- **All Bookings**: `GET /api/bookings` (Backoffice only)
- **Pending Approvals**: `GET /api/bookings/pending` (Station Operators & Backoffice)

### D. EV Operator (Station Operator) Mobile Access ✅

#### 1. Station Operator Authentication
- **Login**: `POST /api/auth/login` with StationOperator role
- **Mobile Access**: JWT token-based authentication

#### 2. QR Code Operations
- **Scan & Validate**: `POST /api/bookings/validate-qr`
- **Booking Management**: Access to booking details and approval

